{% comment %}
  Section contract.
  Tokkey homepage landing page. Each `.sec` is a full-width design image; `.tx` holds
  transparent text laid over the image (for selection and SEO); `.hot` is a clickable
  hotspot over a button drawn in the image.
  Images live in Shopify Admin > Files and are referenced with `file_url`.
  Styles come from `assets/tokkey.css`, loaded by `layout/tokkey.liquid`.
  @example
  <!-- templates/index.json renders this section with "layout": "tokkey" -->
{% endcomment %}

<div class="tokkey-landing">
  {%- comment -%} Fixed nav overlaid on the hero; it carries the Tokkey wordmark, so the hero images omit it. Kept outside .sec, whose container-type would trap the fixed positioning {%- endcomment -%}
